---
to: "infra/gcp/broker/topology.md"
force: true
determinism: true
sparql:
  resources: |
    PREFIX gtf: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/gcp-terraform#>
    SELECT ?order ?type ?name WHERE {
      ?r gtf:inModule gtf:mod_broker ; gtf:order ?order ; gtf:resourceType ?type ; gtf:resourceName ?name .
      FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?r a gtf:ApiService }
    } ORDER BY ?order ?type ?name
  topics: |
    PREFIX fgb: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/fnox-gcp-broker#>
    SELECT ?gcp_name ?dedup WHERE {
      ?t a fgb:Topic ; fgb:gcpName ?gcp_name ; fgb:dedupAttribute ?dedup ; fgb:messageOrdering true .
    } ORDER BY ?gcp_name
  pushes: |
    PREFIX fgb: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/fnox-gcp-broker#>
    SELECT ?gcp_name ?endpoint ?audience ?signer WHERE {
      ?s a fgb:PushSubscription ; fgb:gcpName ?gcp_name ; fgb:pushEndpoint ?endpoint ;
         fgb:oidcAudience ?audience ; fgb:oidcServiceAccount ?sa .
      ?sa fgb:accountId ?signer .
    } ORDER BY ?gcp_name
  intake: |
    PREFIX fgb: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/fnox-gcp-broker#>
    SELECT ?bucket ?trigger ?service ?model ?provenance WHERE {
      ?b a fgb:Bucket ; fgb:gcpName ?bucket ; fgb:finalizeTrigger ?tr .
      ?tr fgb:gcpName ?trigger ; fgb:destination ?svc .
      ?svc fgb:gcpName ?service ; fgb:model ?model ; fgb:provenance ?provenance .
    } ORDER BY ?bucket
  workers: |
    PREFIX fgb: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/fnox-gcp-broker#>
    SELECT ?vendor ?gcp_name ?sa ?secret ?role WHERE {
      ?w a fgb:EgressWorker ; fgb:vendor ?vendor ; fgb:gcpName ?gcp_name ; fgb:runsAs ?s ;
         fgb:accessesSecret ?sec ; fgb:accessorRole ?role .
      ?s fgb:accountId ?sa .
      ?sec fgb:gcpName ?secret .
    } ORDER BY ?vendor
  routes: |
    PREFIX fgb: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/fnox-gcp-broker#>
    SELECT ?gateway ?path ?backend WHERE {
      ?g a fgb:Gateway ; fgb:gcpName ?gateway ; fgb:ingressRoute ?r .
      ?r fgb:routePath ?path ; fgb:routeBackend ?backend .
    } ORDER BY ?gateway ?path
  wi: |
    PREFIX fgb: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/fnox-gcp-broker#>
    SELECT ?sa ?namespace ?ksa WHERE {
      ?b a fgb:WorkloadIdentityBinding ; fgb:bindsAccount ?acct ; fgb:kubernetesNamespace ?namespace ; fgb:kubernetesServiceAccount ?ksa .
      ?acct fgb:accountId ?sa .
    } ORDER BY ?sa
  constraints: |
    PREFIX fgb: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/fnox-gcp-broker#>
    PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
    SELECT ?label ?forbidden ?org_constraint ?rationale WHERE {
      ?c a fgb:Constraint ; rdfs:label ?label ; fgb:forbidsResourceType ?forbidden ;
         fgb:orgPolicyConstraint ?org_constraint ; fgb:rationale ?rationale .
    } ORDER BY ?label
---
# fnox GCP broker topology (Tier 3)

Standing: UNVERIFIED

GENERATED by `ggen sync` from `packs/fnox-gcp-broker-pack/ontology/fnox-gcp-broker.ttl`.
This file is a projection receipt of the graph, not evidence that anything was applied.
Generated Terraform carries no DO authority; `terraform apply` is a separately admitted transition.

## Actuation topic
{% for t in topics %}
- `{{ t.gcp_name }}`: message ordering enabled; consumers dedup on attribute `{{ t.dedup }}`.
{% endfor %}
## Push subscription (OIDC)
{% for p in pushes %}
- `{{ p.gcp_name }}` -> `{{ p.endpoint }}` (audience `{{ p.audience }}`, signer `{{ p.signer }}`).
{% endfor %}
## Intake chain
{% for i in intake %}
- bucket `{{ i.bucket }}` -> Eventarc `{{ i.trigger }}` (object.v1.finalized) -> Cloud Run `{{ i.service }}`
  (Document AI + Vertex `{{ i.model }}`, provenance `{{ i.provenance }}`).
{% endfor %}
## Egress workers (one secret each)

| vendor | service | runtime SA | secret | role |
|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for w in workers %}| {{ w.vendor }} | `{{ w.gcp_name }}` | `{{ w.sa }}` | `{{ w.secret }}` | `{{ w.role }}` |
{% endfor %}
## Webhook ingress (API Gateway)
{% for r in routes %}
- `{{ r.gateway }}` `{{ r.path }}` -> `{{ r.backend }}`
{% endfor %}
## Workload Identity
{% for b in wi %}
- `{{ b.sa }}` <- `{{ b.namespace }}/{{ b.ksa }}` (roles/iam.workloadIdentityUser; no JSON key exists).
{% endfor %}
## Constraints
{% for c in constraints %}
- **{{ c.label }}**: forbids `{{ c.forbidden }}`; org policy `{{ c.org_constraint }}`. {{ c.rationale }}
{% endfor %}
## Resource inventory

| order | type | name |
|---|---|---|
{% for r in resources %}| {{ r.order }} | `{{ r.type }}` | `{{ r.name }}` |
{% endfor %}
## Gates (any row = refusal)

- `gates/010_topic_dedup.rq` — topic without ordering or without `durable_intent_token` dedup.
- `gates/020_worker_single_secret.rq` — egress worker with secret cardinality != 1.
- `gates/030_zero_static_key.rq` — any `google_service_account_key` / `fgb:StaticKey`.
- `gates/040_push_oidc.rq` — push without OIDC/https/topic; service without runtime SA; bucket without intake trigger.
